  "description": "*“That chubby dude will never know what he’s in for.”*\n\nHye-Sung happened to eavesdrop on a conversation amongst his boyfriend’s classmates. But does that mean Hye-Sung’s fashion design major boyfriend, Jung-Won, will eventually move on to skinnier pastures? He can’t let that happen! Hye-Sung is determined to lose weight and keep his lover. If only he knew that Jung-Won actually loves him exactly the way he is…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
